flowchart TD
    A[Mobile Device Camera<br/>Warehouse Staff] --> B[React Native with WatermelonDB<br/>Offline-First iOS/Android]
    B --> C{Scan Barcode}
    C --> D[Validate UPC/EAN<br/>Local SQLite Cache]
    D --> E[Capture 3 Required Photos<br/>Barcode/Label, Overall, Close-up]
    E --> F[Local Storage & Compression<br/>WatermelonDB Offline Queue]
    F --> G{Wi-Fi Available?}
