    G -- Yes --> I[Batch Sync to Cloud]
    I --> J[Upload Photos to<br/>Azure Blob Storage]
    J --> K[Azure Computer Vision<br/>Damage Grading API]
    K --> L[Submit Write-off<br/>with Quantity & AI Score]
    L --> M[PostgreSQL<br/>write_offs Table]
    M --> N[Slack Webhook<br/>Supervisor Notification]
    N --> O[React Web Dashboard<br/>Supervisor Review]
    O --> P{Approve/Reject}
    P --> Q[Update Inventory Status<br/>active → written_off]
    Q --> R[Reduce Stock by Quantity<br/>Update current_stock]
    R --> S[Email Confirmation<br/>SMTP via SendGrid]
    M --> T[Reporting Engine<br/>CSV Export]
    T --> U[Monthly Compliance<br/>Excel/Sheets]
    H -- On Connectivity Restore --> I
    D -- Scan Failed --> V[Search by Description/Category<br/>or Photo for Later ID]
    E -- Validation --> W[3-Photo Requirement<br/>Enforced Before Submit]